  "fullContentHtml": "\n<div class=\"ast-post-format- single-layout-1 ast-no-date-box\" style=\"height: auto !important;\">\n\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 13pt;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong>Short Information :</strong> </span>has recently released the official notification for the recruitment of Bus Conductor posts (Gorakhpur District) on its official website. The online application process for UPSRTC Bus Conductor Recruitment 2026 has started in 08 July 2026, and candidates can apply until 16 July 2026. Candidates must check the complete details for UPSRTC Bus Conductor Recruitment 2026, which are given below.</span></p>\n<div class=\"entry-content clear\" style=\"height: auto !important;\">\n<div class=\"newtable1\">\n<table style=\"font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; height: auto !important; width: 100%;\" width=\"100%\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"100%\">\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\">Uttar Pradesh State Road Transport Corporation</span></h2>\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #008000;\">UPSRTC Bus Conductor Recruitment 2026</span></h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>Important Dates</b></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Application Start : <b>08 July 2026</b></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Last Date for Apply : <span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><b>16 July 2026</b></span></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Interview Date : <strong><b>District Wise</b></strong></span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>Application Fee</b></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>No Application Fee</strong></span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"p